# Star Tech Ltd.
> Star Tech is a leading computer, laptop, and gadget retail & online shop in Bangladesh, operating 20+ physical stores nationwide since March 2007. Star Tech is ISO 9001:2015 certified and sells laptops, desktops, PC components, monitors, mobile phones, cameras, networking gear, security systems, servers & storage, software, office equipment, TVs, home appliances, gaming gear, computer accessories, and smart gadgets, with services including PC building, device repair, and home service support. Star Tech's motto is "Customer Comes First."

## Key Features
- **EMI Facility**: Flexible installment options available on eligible products
- **Online Delivery**: Nationwide delivery service across Bangladesh
- **Home Service**: Expert technician visits available for setup and repair
- **Servicing Center**: Dedicated repair and maintenance center for devices
- **PC Builder Tool**: Custom PC configuration tool to build your ideal desktop
- **Laptop Finder**: Guided tool to help customers find the right laptop
- **Affiliate Program**: Earn commissions by referring customers to Star Tech
- **Star Point Policy**: Loyalty rewards program for repeat customers

